Vikram and Betal: The Honest Answer (Raw Story)

id: WBX_100125

King Vikram was carrying Betal through the forest once again.

Betal began his story.

“Once there was a young boy who always spoke the truth,” said Betal. “Everyone trusted him.”

One day, the king asked the boy, “Tell me, who is the most important person in your life?”

The boy thought for a moment and said, “The person who needs my help the most.”

The king was surprised.

He asked, “Why do you say that?”

The boy replied, “Because helping others is the most important thing we can do.”

The king was very pleased with his answer.

He rewarded the boy for his honesty and wisdom.

Betal then asked, “Vikram, why was the boy’s answer special?”

Vikram replied, “Because it showed both honesty and kindness.”

As soon as Vikram spoke, Betal flew back to the tree.

💖 Moral:

Helping others is the most important duty.
